From 065a37916c91296b405987b13af980797efc169d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Khaled <khaledchoucri@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 02:38:01 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 106/107] POC-31: 46 Gen 4 moves with Platinum's numbers (M1c
 M5a), the Gen 4 physical/special split for every move (M3b), the new
 learnsets with a Lv 10/20/30 ladder for every Hoenn line (L1a L2c L3a L5a
 M2a) whose three chips share a code, open from the start (L4a), a grid kind
 and BN6 effect per new move as in the table (M4a); 8 new grid effects
 (Wake-Up Slap, Brine, Charge Beam, Hammer Arm, Close Combat, Flare Blitz,
 Head Smash, the fangs); pkbn.sav v10 widens the per-move arrays (355 -> 401
 moves) from older files field by field; moves may have 6 codes

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FbWSqvcg6G5Gpw6ynvR5tJ
